-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-08-22T21:19:24Z","updated_at":"2026-02-07T12:35:28Z","closed_at":"2025-08-27T00:02:33Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109887","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109887","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109887.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109887.patch","merged_at":"2025-08-27T00:02:33Z"},"body":"This is a further enhancement on top of PR #109100. Fixes #109852 and #107095.\r\n\r\nThis PR rescales values to better utilize R128's range before snapping. R128 is fixed-precision with 64 bits after the decimal point, but double already uses 53 of those, so a step size finer than 2^-11 will lose precision (2^-53 multiplied by 2^-11 is 2^-64 which is the limit of R128's fixed precision), and in practice even 1e-3 can be problematic. By rescaling the value and step, we can shift precision into the higher bits (effectively turning R128 into a makeshift float).\r\n\r\nIt seems that my initial declaration in PR #109100 that a 128-bit float was the ideal solution to the problem was actually correct, and we should really use such a thing once Godot upgrades to a C++ version where it's supported.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109887/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109887/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}